                <note rend="inline" type="source">637.0023/24: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Howell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-08-11T10:00:00-05:29"><hi rendition="#italic">August 11,
                                1923—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 12:06
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>72. Your 67, August 10, noon, and Mr. Wright’s<anchor n="29" xml:id="d684-f1"/>
                    conversation by telephone.</p>
                <p>The note regarding Tarafa bill was handed to the Secretary of State last
                    night.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Howell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
